    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
<!-- LB-3D-HERO -->
<canvas id="bdc" aria-hidden="true" class="lb3d-canvas"></canvas>
<style>
#bdc { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; z-index:0; pointer-events:none; }
.hero .wrap, .hero .hero-photo { position:relative; z-index:2; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ #bdc { display:none; } }
</style>


  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kick">Design & Construct · Newcastle & the Hunter</div>
    <h1>Designed.<br>Built.<br><span class="acc">Delivered.</span><span class="thin">New builds &middot; Renovations &middot; Drafting &middot; Design</span></h1>
    <div class="hero-sub">
      <p class="rv d2">From the first sketch to the final fix — design, drafting and construction under one roof. Firm quotes before work starts.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas rv d3">
        <a href="#quote" class="btn btn-acc">Get a free quote</a>
        <a href="tel:+61420225865" class="btn btn-ghost">Call 0420 225 865</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-photo">
    <div class="ph">
      <img src="images/sids-innovative-designs-logo.jpg" alt="Sid's Innovative Designs and Construction logo" style="max-width:300px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(0,0,0,.45);">
      <span class="cap mono">Design &amp; construct &middot; Newcastle &amp; the Hunter</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="sa-marquee" id="areas" aria-label="Service area">
  <div class="mq-track"><span class="mq-item">Design &amp; Construct</span><span class="mq-item">New Builds</span><span class="mq-item">Renovations</span><span class="mq-item">Architectural Drafting</span><span class="mq-item">Design &amp; Construct</span><span class="mq-item">New Builds</span><span class="mq-item">Renovations</span><span class="mq-item">Architectural Drafting</span></div>
</div>

<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-idx rv">01</div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="rv d1">What we build.</h2>
        <p class="lead rv d2">From the first sketch to the final coat of paint — we own the project so nothing slips between trades.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Design &amp; construct</h3><p>Integrated design and construction services — managed from initial concept through to handover.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
      <div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Renovations & extensions</h3><p>Room additions, kitchen & bathroom upgrades, granny flats and second-storey additions.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
      <div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Architectural drafting</h3><p>Preliminary sketches, working drawings, DA and CDC documentation for residential projects.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
      <div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Renovations</h3><p>Home extensions, granny flats, kitchen and bathroom renovations and structural alterations.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="statement" id="builders">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h2 class="rv">Design to <span class="acc">handover</span></h2>
      <p class="rv d1" style="margin-top:22px;">One team owns the whole project — concept, working drawings, approvals and construction — so nothing gets lost between designer and builder.</p>
      <div class="btn-row rv d2">
        <a href="#quote" class="btn btn-acc">Request a quote</a>
        <a  class="btn btn-ghost">Email us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sub-pts">
      <div class="sub-pt rv"><div class="tick">&#10003;</div><div><b>Design &amp; drafting</b><span>Concept sketches, working drawings and DA/CDC documentation handled in-house.</span></div></div>
      <div class="sub-pt rv d1"><div class="tick">&#10003;</div><div><b>Construction</b><span>Your build managed start to finish by a builder who is on site every day.</span></div></div>
